进云山\n后来名帖散尽 谁记当年少年\n只余旧剑纸伞里 有你走时的风寒\n\n[Bridge]\n这世道 人情薄\n刀口添几道刻痕也算活\n我撑伞过市声如昨\n不敢回头怕记得太多 (哦)\n\n[Chorus]\n你说江湖太远 走着走着就散\n笑我执伞赶路 把风雪当做衣衫\n如果来生再见 把名字写伞檐\n挂在旧剑旁边等 雨停的那一天"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 69, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "title": "自动歌词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [90], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [" "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "title": "手动歌词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [391.04327392578125, 529.429443359375], "pos": [480.06500244140625, -54.344295501708984], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [92], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["武侠主题曲，歌词参考：旧剑纸伞\n "], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [385.70904541015625, 228.34727478027344], "pos": [483.6911315917969, -357.194580078125], "id": 63, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [100], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1881.8377685546875, -122.56167602539062], "widgets_values": ["C major\nC# major \nDb major\nD major\nD# major\nEb major\nE major\nF major\nF# major\nGb major\nG major\nG# major\nAb major\nA major\nA# maj